__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){var t=r(d[0]);Object.defineProperty(e,"__esModule",{value:!0}),e.default=void 0;var o=t(r(d[1])),n=t(r(d[2])),s=(0,o.default)(function t(){(0,n.default)(this,t)});s.PRIVACY_POLICY='<div style="font-family: gotham-bold; color: white;"><p style="font-size: 45px; padding-bottom: 10px;"><strong>PRIVACY DISCLOSURE FOR SELF TOUR</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">This Privacy Disclosure applies to the Pynwheel Tour smartphone application, owned and operated by Pynwheel, Inc. We receive or collect information that identifies you personally if you choose to use Pynwheel Tour. We also use common technologies, such as cookies, location and facial recognition in Pynwheel Tour to collect information about you.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px;  font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">In the course of operating Pynwheel Tour, we will collect the following information:</span></p><ul><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; line-height: 60px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Your name, signatures, addresses, telephone numbers, email addresses, and other unique identifiers; or passwords or PINs, user identification and account access credentials or passwords;</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; line-height: 60px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Your credit card information and student information,&nbsp;</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; line-height: 60px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Personal identifiers such as photographs and drivers licenses, your fingerprints, signatures, voice, facial recognition, or any other biometrics collected or received by your mobile device;&nbsp;</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; line-height: 60px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Your location, and&nbsp;</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Your files, including images, videos, notes, comments and other text.</span></li></ul><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Once we have collected the information described above, we will share your information with third-party owners and/or property managers of the real estate properties that you have signed up to view using Pynwheel Tour. We may also share your personal information for various reasons, including sharing your information in a way that might help us improve our application or services to you. We will not link data collected from the app with third-party data for advertising purposes; nor will we share the collected data with a data broker.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Please see our Privacy Policy, located at </span><a href="https://pynwheeltouchscreens.com/privacy-policy"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">https://pynwheeltouchscreens.com/privacy-policy</span></a><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"> for a full disclosure of how we collect and use the personal information you or your mobile device provides through or on Pynwheel Tour.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">From here, your choices are:</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">By downloading, installing, using, and providing information to or through Pynwheel Tour, you consent to all actions taken by us with respect to your information in compliance with the Privacy Policy.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You may request removal from our database by emailing us at support@pynwheel.com.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">If you have any questions or suggestions regarding this Privacy Disclosure or our Privacy Policy, please e-mail us at support@pynwheel.com</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Effective Date 12/5/19</span></p></div>',s.TERMS_OF_USE='<div style="color: white;"><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 45px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>SELF TOUR TERMS OF USE</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">This agreement ("Agreement" or "Terms of Use") applies to the Pynwheel Tour smartphone application provided by Pynwheel, Inc. ("Owner"). IF YOU DO NOT AGREE WITH THESE TERMS, DO NOT USE SELF TOUR. BY CLICKING THE "I AGREE" OR "I ACCEPT" BUTTON, YOU ACKNOWLEDGE THAT YOU HAVE READ AND UNDERSTOOD THIS AGREEMENT.</span></p><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 45px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Limited Use</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Your use of Pynwheel Tour is limited to an on-premise access and tour of a designated property assigned by the third-party owner and/or property manager of the real estate property ("Property Parties") that you have signed up to view. Your use, photos and personal identifiable information provided on Pynwheel Tour will be shared with the Owner and Property Parties. You will not use Pynwheel Tour if you are not over the age of 18 or for any other use unless authorized by Owner or Property Parties. Your access may be shut off at any time at the sole discretion of the Owner.</span></p><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 45px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Acceptance of Terms and Conditions</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">By continuing to use Pynwheel Tour, you agree:</span></p><ul><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">This Agreement is a legally binding Agreement and the equivalent of a signed, written contract.</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You will use Pynwheel Tour in a manner consistent with applicable laws and regulations and in accordance with the terms and conditions in this Agreement.</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You understand, accept, and have received this Agreement and its terms and conditions, andacknowledge and demonstrate that you can access this Agreement.</span></li></ul><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 48px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Owner\u2019s License to You</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Owner grants you a single, non-exclusive, non-transferable and limited personal license to access and use Pynwheel Tour. This license is conditioned on your continued compliance with this Agreement. You may not rent, lease, lend, sell, transfer redistribute, or sublicense Pynwheel Tour. You will not copy, decompile, reverse-engineer, disassemble, attempt to derive the source code of, modify, or create derivative works of Pynwheel Tour, any updates, or any part thereof (except as and only to the extent that any foregoing restriction is prohibited by applicable law or to the extent as may be permitted by the licensing terms governing use of any components included with Pynwheel Tour).</span></p><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 48px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Your License to Owner and Property Parties</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Any communications, photos or material of any kind that you email, post, or otherwise transmit using the Pynwheel Tour, including data, questions, comments, or suggestions (your \u201cCommunications\u201d) will become the property of Owner and Property Parties. You hereby grant a license to Owner and Property Parties to use any ideas, concepts, know-how, or techniques contained in your Communications for any purpose including, but not limited to, developing and marketing properties and products using such information. </span></p><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 48px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"> <strong>Use of Owner Services</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">The following requirements also apply to your use of Pynwheel Tour:</span></p><ul><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You will not use any electronic communication feature of Pynwheel Tour for any purpose that is unlawful, tortious, abusive, intrusive on another\u2019s privacy, harassing, libelous, defamatory, embarrassing, obscene, threatening, or hateful.</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You will not use Pynwheel Tour to upload, post, reproduce, or distribute any information, software, or other material protected by copyright or any other intellectual property right (as well as rights of publicity and privacy) without first obtaining the permission of the Owner of such rights.</span></li><li style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">You will not use Pynwheel Tour for any commercial purpose not expressly approved by Owner in writing. You will not use Pynwheel Tour to upload, post, email, or otherwise transmit any advertising or promotional materials or any other form of solicitation or unauthorized communication.</span></li></ul><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 48px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Security of Data Transmission and Storage</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Electronic communications using Pynwheel Tour may not always be encrypted. You acknowledge that there is a risk that data, including email, electronic communications, and personal data, may be accessed by unauthorized third parties when communicated between you and Owner or between you and other parties, including the Property Parties.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Owner and its affiliates, and agents are permitted, but not obligated, to review or retain your Communications. Owner may monitor your Communications to evaluate the quality of service you receive, your compliance with the Agreement, the security of Pynwheel Tour, or for other reasons. You agree that such monitoring activities will not entitle you to any cause of action or other right with respect to the manner in which Owner or its affiliates or agents monitor your Communications and enforces or fails to enforce the terms of the Agreement. In no event will Owner or any of its affiliates or agents be liable for any costs, damages, expenses, or any other liabilities incurred by you as a result of monitoring activities by Owner or its affiliates or agents.</span></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size: 48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Owner may collect, maintain, process and share with Property Parties your personally identifiable information and other sensitive information and data collected by Pynwheel Tour (\u201cUser Data\u201d). User Data may include, for example, names, signatures, addresses, telephone numbers, email addresses, and other unique identifiers; or passwords or PINs, user identification and account access credentials or passwords, financial account numbers, credit card information, student information, and other personal identifiers such as photographs and driver\u2019s licenses. This information will be treated in accordance with Owner&#39;s Privacy Policy, as amended from time to time, which can be viewed at: <a href="https://pynwheeltouchscreens.com/privacy-policy">https://pynwheeltouchscreens.com/privacy-policy.</a> </span></p><p style="font-family: gotham-bold; font-size: 48px; padding-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"><strong>Hyperlinks</strong></p><p style="line-height: 60px;    margin-bottom: 30px;"><span style="font-size:48px; font-family: gotham-light; color: white;">Pynwheel Tour may contain links to other sites. Owner does not control such other sites, and Owner and itsaffiliates and agents make no representations whatsoever concerning the content, accuracy, security or privacy of those sites. You agree that under no circumstance